 of our Global Strategic Alliance as a further step in achieving our goal and believe we are early …", "a": "Director President and Group CEO of SMFG, Toru Nakashima commented", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/96223/000114036125035471/ef20055770_ex99-1.htm"}, {"d": "2025-01-08", "n": 0.0, "z": null, "rz": null, "earn": false, "q": "Our bench is deep, our talent operates in every relevant corner of the globe... and our culture is unified and filled with purpose and optimism.", "a": "2024 S H A R EHO L D ER L E T T ER 7 J EF F ER I E S working daily with them to align our efforts and client relationships. We are confident", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/96223/000114036125000642/ef20041231_ex99-1.htm"}, {"d": "2024-08-12", "n": 3.41, "z": null, "rz": null, "earn": false, "q": "We are honored to welcome Nakashima-san to our Board of Directors. All of us at Jefferies look forward to the expansion and strengthening of our strategic alliance with SMBC and we are eager to deploy all our capabilities to bring value to their clients and stakeholders. The appointment of Nakashima-san will bring to o…", "a": "Jefferies’ CEO, Rich Handler, and President, Brian Friedman, stated", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/96223/000119312524198339/d853943dex991.htm"}, {"d": "2024-08-01", "n": 5.66, "z": null, "rz": null, "earn": false, "q": "We are pleased to complete the sale of OpNet’s operation to Wind Tre, the last in a series of transactions that monetized a substantial portion of our legacy merchant-banking assets. Achieving that goal further accelerates our efforts to build the very best ‘pure play’ global Investment Banking and Capital Markets firm…", "a": "Rich Handler, CEO of Jefferies, and Brian Friedman, President of Jefferies, commented", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/96223/000119312524190571/d834269dex991.htm"}], "now": null}, "score": {"value": 46, "verdict": {"it": "Nessuna convinzione chiara", "en": "No clea